  "idea": "Ollama: run powerful AI models completely free on your laptop",
  "text": "Here is how you talk to local AI models completely offline for free. Traveling or spotty internet connections normally cut you off from cloud-based AI writing and coding assistants. Web chatbots freeze completely without active wifi, stalling critical work when you need answers most. Ollama runs open-source models like Mistral entirely on your local machine without any internet connection. You maintain peak productivity anywhere in the world.",
